                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b13f5c23-a5a2-43a1-bda6-922e0d5709da",
                                "sense_id": "1915b82f-84bc-3dd3-9e2b-d4c6e9ec25dc",
                                "text": "Передо́нов подошё́л к стене́ и принялся́ колоти́ть по ней подо́швами. Воло́дин по его́ приме́ру то́же ляга́л сте́ну. Передо́нов сказа́л:\n— Мы всегда́, когда́ еди́м, па́костим сте́ны, — пусть по́мнит.",
                                "translation": "Peredonov walked up to the wall and began to wipe the soles of his boots on it. Volodin followed his example. Peredonov said:\n\"We always dirty the walls after every meal, so that they'll remember us when we've gone!\"",
                                "english": "Peredonov walked up to the wall and began to wipe the soles of his boots on it. Volodin followed his example. Peredonov said:\n\"We always dirty the walls after every meal, so that they'll remember us when we've gone!\""
